!Name: p45forwrake-3
!C Period 45 c/3 forwards rake.
!C This puffer produces a forwards glider every 45 generations.
!C It is based on a period 45 back rake whose double-backwards gliders are
!C perturbed by a period 15 and a period 3 spaceship.  The first backwards
!C glider is turned into a boat, and the second backwards glider impacts on
!C the boat to become the forwards glider.
!C David I. Bell, July 1997
!Source: jslife-moving
!
